Data and fixtures
-----------------

No bibliographic data, credentials, cookies, or session material is distributed
with this project.

The HTML files under tests/fixtures/ are page **structure** recorded from public
pages, then desensitised:

  - abstracts, author names, affiliations and keyword labels were replaced with
    synthetic placeholders;
  - mail addresses and any session-scoped parameters were removed;
  - what remains is markup, class names, and public bibliographic facts (article
    titles, journal names, volume/issue/page numbers, DOIs).

They exist so the parsers can be tested offline without touching the site.
